./docs/requirements/decisions/scope-check-missing-guidance-execution-plan.md:449:  "background":"## Trigger Event\nA PLAN review blocker reported missing_scope_check. The command scope_check_save already exists; the missing artifact is scope-check.json. The user confusion is guidance/actionability, not missing CLI capability.\n\n## Key Insights\nPLAN scope evidence must remain reviewer-written and gate-consumed. Local CLI guidance is Non-authority and must not be described as receipt-backed Authority Server proof.\n\n## Solution Tradeoffs\nPrefer narrow wording and help updates over a new lifecycle assistant. Do not weaken gates or auto-generate evidence.\n\n## Conversational Texture\nThe user wants Proofbound to execute this plan later, but this document itself is not the implementation."
